["TEXT","e437",130,266,0,"PA74 controls external Flash power. MPI4 = PA30 CS, PA39 CLK, PA40 D0, PA37 D1, PA36 D2, PA38 D3.","small",0]
["TEXT","e438",130,242,0,"This bank is fixed at 3.3 V. Enable and settle FLASH_VDD before access; place bus pins Hi-Z before power-off.","small",0]
["TEXT","e439",130,218,0,"Pin map/power switch follows the SiFli N16R32N1 reference. Firmware BSP must retain correct SiP and Flash startup control.","small",0]
["TEXT","e440",130,194,0,"Module BOM removed. The final board purchases U1, U104, crystals and passives individually; no 24x24 mm core module.","small",0]
